# Task files
# The Task Master scaffold ignores these by default. We track them instead:
# tasks/tasks.json is the shared backlog and belongs in version control.
# The generated per-task files (tasks/task_*.txt) stay ignored — regenerate with
# `npm run generate` after editing tasks.json.
tasks/task_*.txt 